# BELLHOP: proof the game can be completed. From the title, the demo pilot
# plays the whole game with real presses: the story, all fifty stages in
# order (no warps), the five crystal rooms and the five bosses, taking all
# forty cups of tea, to the ending. That earns all three goals: fifteen
# spare ships, the fifty stages, and the win with every cup.
seed 7
game bellhop
wait 20
botuntil state == 2 600
botuntil stage == 10 60000
expect tea == 8
botuntil stage == 20 60000
expect tea == 16
botuntil stage == 30 60000
expect tea == 24
botuntil stage == 40 60000
expect tea == 32
botuntil state == 7 60000
expect tea == 40
expect goals == 7
expect wins == 1
expect best_tea == 40
